    <cell width="202" pady="10">
     <color r="255" g="255" b="255"><font name="Gulim" size="10">Night sharks forage primarily on squids, small fishes, and shrimp.</font></color>
    </cell>
	<cell width="32" pady="10">
		<img src="ui/zoopedia/fact-bullet.tga" sx="0" sy="0" sw="32" sh="32" />
	</cell>    
    <cell width="202" pady="10">
     <color r="255" g="255" b="255"><font name="Gulim" size="10">The night shark is caught mainly on longlines, usually at night as bycatch from pelagic longline fisheries targeting tunas.  </font></color>
    </cell>
	<cell width="32" pady="10">
		<img src="ui/zoopedia/fact-bullet.tga" sx="0" sy="0" sw="32" sh="32" />
	</cell>        
    <cell width="202" pady="10">
     <color r="255" g="255" b="255"><font name="Gulim" size="10">The night shark is a slim shark with a very long, pointed snout, large eyes, and small jaws with oblique cusped serrated upper teeth.</font></color>
       
    </cell>
